## Your First Gel French Tips Won't Be Your Best Ones

The first set teaches you your hands, how much pressure your stamper needs, which direction your smile line wants to pull, how long your specific lamp takes. The second set is where it clicks.

<strong>How to do french tip gel nails</strong> at home is a skill, and skills have a learning curve. What most tutorials fail to tell you is that the process is actually quite forgiving before anything is cured, you can wipe, redo, and reposition as many times as you need. The lamp is what makes it permanent. Use that window. Once you are comfortable with a single tip, try the <a href='https://mirelleinspo.com/blog/blooming-gel-nails' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>blooming gel nail technique</a> as your next experiment, it uses the same gel system in a completely different direction.

The kit you put together now will serve you for every gel look you try from here. That is the real value of learning this at home.
